 "remarks": "Introducing 12 Beltas Farm Lane, an extraordinary new construction estate in Westport, Connecticut, set within Beltas Farm-one of Westport's newest and most distinctive luxury enclaves. Once part of a 23-acre working family farm, this special setting has been thoughtfully transformed into an intimate collection of exceptional residences, with nearly five acres preserved as open space. The result is something increasingly rare in Westport: beautiful open views, a sense of space and privacy, and an enclave of significant luxury homes. Offered at $7,895,000 and built by Fairfield County Contractors, known for exceptional quality and craftsmanship, this remarkable new Westport home encompasses more than 9,000 square feet of sophisticated living space. A handsome wood roof introduces timeless architecture and the exceptional level of finish found throughout. Designed for today's luxury lifestyle, the residence features six ensuite bedrooms and beautifully proportioned living and entertaining spaces filled with natural light and oriented to capture the property's open views. A wine cellar adds another layer to the home's exceptional entertaining spaces, while the thoughtful floor plan balances impressive scale with comfortable everyday living. Outside, a stunning pool and spa create a private resort experience surrounded by the beauty and openness of the Beltas Farm setting. What distinguishes 12 Beltas Farm Lane is not simply the caliber of the new construction, but the rarity",
